Idle-skip made cheap (docs/idle-skip.md): linear table of loop heads instead of std::map, the previous
turn is compared in place and copied only when the turn differs, 32-bit division when the values fit.
Same decisions as 0004/0011; IdleTurn and the saved state are unchanged.

diff -ru f32a/runtime/include/dream/runtime/system.h f32b/runtime/include/dream/runtime/system.h
--- f32a/runtime/include/dream/runtime/system.h
